{"qid": "con_00002", "category": "concept", "bucket": "b1", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 163849.08, "n_tokens": 123, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.46153846153846156, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 220, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "key_recall=0.46 (>=0.40) refusal=False", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国民法典》第469条规定：“当事人订立合同，可以采取要约、承诺方式或者其他方式。”因此，合同成立需要满足以下条件：\n\n1. 当事人意思表示一致：即双方就合同的主要条款达成合意。\n2. 合同内容合法有效：合同的内容不得违反法律和社会公共利益。\n3. 合同形式符合规定：合同可以通过书面、口头或其他形式签订。\n\n具体到您的问题，如果合同中明确规定了双方的权利和义务，并且没有违反法律法规的规定，则该合同已经成立并具有法律效力。", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 3.632, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2022）渝01民终252号_1", "score": 0.0926, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）渝01民终252号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）沪01民终931号_1", "score": 0.0926, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）沪01民终931号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京03民初641号_1", "score": 0.0926, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京03民初641号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京02民再671号_1", "score": 0.0926, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京02民再671号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）渝01民初352号_1", "score": 0.0926, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）渝01民初352号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）沪02民终2849号_1", "score": 0.0926, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）沪02民终2849号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）沪02民再2641号_1", "score": 0.0926, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）