{"qid": "con_00009", "category": "concept", "bucket": "b1", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 157253.58, "n_tokens": 128, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 1.0, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 236, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "key_recall=1.00 (>=0.40) refusal=False", "answer": "当事人应当按照约定全面履行自己的义务，这是基于《中华人民共和国民法典》第五百零九条的规定。该条规定指出，当事人应当遵循诚实信用原则，根据合同的性质、目的和交易习惯履行通知、协助、保密等义务。\n\n要构成当事人应当按照约定全面履行自，需要满足以下条件：\n\n1. **合同存在**：首先，双方之间必须存在有效的合同关系。\n2. **合同内容明确**：合同中应当明确规定当事人的权利和义务。\n3. **合同条款具体**：合同中的条款应当具体明确，避免模糊不清。\n4. **遵守合同", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 3.775, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_509", "score": 0.6897, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 509, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京02民终2579号_1", "score": 0.0481, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京02民终2579号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京01民终2955号_1", "score": 0.0481, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京01民终2955号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）渝01民终1790号_1", "score": 0.0475, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）渝01民终1790号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京02民终2058号_1", "score": 0.0475, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京02民终2058号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）闽01民再411号_1", "score": 0.0475, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）闽01民再411号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）津02民终2407号_1", "score": 0.0475, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）津02民终2407号"