{"qid": "con_00015", "category": "concept", "bucket": "b1", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 128181.83, "n_tokens": 128, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 1.0, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 217, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "key_recall=1.00 (>=0.40) refusal=False", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国民法典》的相关规定：\n\n1. **限制民事行为能力**：根据《民法典》第十九条规定，八周岁以上的未成年人为限制民事行为能力人，实施民事法律行为由其法定代理人代理或者经其法定代理人同意、追认；但是，可以独立实施纯获利益的民事法律行为或者与其年龄、智力相适应的民事法律行为。\n\n2. **主要要件**：\n   - 年龄：须达到8周岁以上。\n   - 智力状况：应当能够理解与其年龄、智力相适应的行为内容。\n   - 相", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 3.696, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_497", "score": 0.6705, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 497, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_19", "score": 0.6381, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 19, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_143", "score": 0.5513, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 143, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_144", "score": 0.4991, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 144, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_20", "score": 0.4709, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 20, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民事诉讼法_2023修正_122", "score": 0.3681, "type": "provision", "law": "民事诉讼法", "article": 122, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典时间效力规定_2020_1", "score": 0.2989, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典时间效力规定", "article": 1, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典时间效力规定_2020_2", "score": 0.2945, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典时间效力规定", "article": 2, "case_no": n