{"qid": "con_00020", "category": "concept", "bucket": "b1", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 196328.5, "n_tokens": 128, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.25, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 236, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "key_recall=0.25 (>=0.40) refusal=False", "answer": "根据您提供的案例，这些案件涉及的是民间借贷纠纷，其中借款金额和利率都是关键因素。以下是一些常见的法律原则和规定：\n\n1. **借款金额**：一般情况下，借款金额没有明确的标准，但通常会考虑借款的实际用途、借款人的经济状况以及借款期限等因素来确定合理的借款金额。\n\n2. **利率**：根据《中华人民共和国合同法》的规定，民间借贷的利率不得超过银行同期贷款基准利率的四倍（对于一年期贷款算五年期）。超过这个限度的利息是不受法律保护的。此外，最高人民法院还规定了“自然人之间的", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 3.867, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2022）沪01民再1266号_0", "score": 0.125, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）沪01民再1266号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）京01民初2954号_0", "score": 0.125, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）京01民初2954号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）沪01民初1444号_0", "score": 0.125, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）沪01民初1444号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）沪02民初2589号_0", "score": 0.125, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）沪02民初2589号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）京03民初1255号_0", "score": 0.125, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）京03民初1255号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）京03民终2848号_0", "score": 0.125, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）京03民终2848号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）京02民初1794号_0", "score": 0.125, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（