{"qid": "con_00024", "category": "concept", "bucket": "b1", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 192876.64, "n_tokens": 128, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 1.0, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 219, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "key_recall=1.00 (>=0.40) refusal=False", "answer": "根据您提供的资料，\"感情确已破裂\"是法院判决离婚的一个必要条件。具体来说，在《中华人民共和国民法典》第一千零七十九条规定了离婚的法定理由之一：\n\n**第一千零七十九条**\n\n夫妻一方要求离婚的，可以由有关组织进行调解或者直接向人民法院提起离婚诉讼。\n\n人民法院审理离婚案件，应当进行调解；如果感情确已破裂，调解无效的，应当准予离婚。\n\n有下列情形之一，调解无效的，应当准予离婚：\n\n（一）重婚或者与他人同居；\n（二）实施家庭暴力或者虐待、", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.262, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2023）闽01民初2411号_0", "score": 0.1429, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）闽01民初2411号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）川01民终2149号_0", "score": 0.1429, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）川01民终2149号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）闽01民终1494号_0", "score": 0.1429, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）闽01民终1494号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）闽01民终1471号_0", "score": 0.1429, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）闽01民终1471号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京02民再413号_0", "score": 0.1429, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京02民再413号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京02民初443号_0", "score": 0.1429, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京02民初443号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京02民初502号_0", "score": 0.1429, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京02民初5